'''Cauliflower Seeds''' are a type of seed. Mature plants yield [[Cauliflower]].

They can be purchased  at [[Pierre's General Store]], at [[JojaMart]], from the Magic Shop Boat at the [[Night Market]] on Winter 15, and occasionally from the [[Traveling Cart]]. Nine seeds can be obtained from [[Gunther]] at the [[Museum]] after donating 5 items. Seeds can also be obtained by using the [[Seed Maker]], as well as having a chance of being planted when using [[Mixed Seeds]].  Five to twenty Cauliflower Seeds may occasionally be found in [[Skull Cavern#Treasure Rooms|treasure rooms]] in the Skull Cavern. Eight to twenty Cauliflower Seeds may be received from opening a [[Mystery Box]] or [[Golden Mystery Box]].

